# MASTER PROMPT: DESIGN AND BUILD LUXOR.VIP
## Premium Luxor Tourism, Experiences, Accommodation & Transport Platform

### 1. ROLE AND MISSION

Act as an elite multidisciplinary team consisting of a senior UI/UX designer, creative director, full-stack engineer, motion designer, tourism business strategist, SEO expert, AI engineer, accessibility specialist, and conversion-rate optimization expert.

Design and build **LUXOR.VIP**, a visually stunning, multilingual, responsive, high-performance tourism and travel booking platform dedicated to Luxor, Egypt.

Website name: LUXOR.VIP  
Brand positioning: Premium, immersive, trustworthy, culturally authentic, elegant, and modern.  
Primary objective: Turn website visitors into confirmed bookings and inquiries.  
Target audiences: International tourists, couples, families, solo travelers, luxury travelers, history enthusiasts, and visitors looking for local accommodation and reliable transportation.

The website must feel like an exceptional combination of a luxury travel magazine, a premium travel concierge, and a modern booking marketplace.

Do not create only a static mockup. Build a functional, production-oriented web application with real navigation, responsive layouts, booking flows, multilingual support, working forms, a scalable backend architecture, and a clear deployment strategy.

